1835	1890	1831	1831	he	86	“ to receive visitors of distinction in ; but we must fit our feelings to our station . While I am not ashamed to own the cause which brought me here , why should I blush at my situation ? Our misfortunes are not our faults ; and were it not for that poor girl-- ”
